Conflicts: calamares, calamares-settings-debian
Replaces: calamares, calamares-settings-debian
Provides: calamares
Description: guided system installer for Edukasaun OS and DebION GNU/Linux
 Corry installs Edukasaun OS or DebION GNU/Linux from a live session, step by
 step: welcome, system check, location, keyboard, partitions (including
 GParted), users, installation with a slideshow and music, and finish. It
 works with and without internet and removes itself from the installed
 system.
 .
 Corry is based on Calamares 3.3.15 and replaces Debian's calamares and
 calamares-settings-debian packages; what is left of them is purged
 automatically.

Package: corry-edukasaun
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, corry (>= ${source:Version})
Conflicts: corry-profile, calamares-settings-debian
Replaces: corry-profile, calamares-settings-debian
Provides: corry-profile
Description: Corry installer profile for Edukasaun OS
 Branding (names, colors, slides, video and music) and installer settings for
 Edukasaun OS. Makes Corry the default installer of the live session: menu
 entry, desktop icon for the live user and the install-debian command.

